00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:04.600
Hello friends and welcome to the table tonight.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:09.600
We are super just privileged and honored to have you here

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:14.600
and it's really a gift to be able to share this space every week.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:20.600
This morning I was sitting in my bedroom

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:25.600
and I was just looking out our window

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:30.600
and we have some tall trees in our front yard

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:35.600
and typically during the summer it's just a canopy of leaves

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:40.600
but right now of course it's winter time and there's no leaves on the trees and they're bare

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:45.600
and it's typically not my favorite time of year.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:50.600
I have trouble appreciating the beauty of winter.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:55.600
I looked out my window and this morning especially was just a cloudy day.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:06:00.600
It looked very gray and I was missing the sunlight

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:05.600
that typically pours in through my bedroom window in the morning

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.600
but without the leaves there I could actually see the sky

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:15.600
and I could see these clouds and in between the lines of clouds

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:20.600
it was just so obvious that the sun was behind it

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:25.600
and kind of breaking through these little slits

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:30.600
and you could just see it was just as if something was hiding it

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:35.600
and I could not help but in that moment think of how many times in my life

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:40.600
there's this feeling of like we're on our own

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:45.600
and it's hard.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:50.600
Times can get discouraging. Life can be troubling

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:55.600
and recently that has been true at large in our society

00:06:55.600 --> 00:07:00.600
and the world we're living in

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:05.600
and I took such encouragement from that moment because I just had this thought of

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:10.600
oh man for a minute there I thought the sun was gone.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:15.600
I thought there wasn't any sun and then I had this visual

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:20.600
of where it really was like oh it's been there the whole time.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:25.600
There were just other things in its way kind of distracting from its presence

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:30.600
but that actually didn't mess with the reality of the sunlight at all

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:35.600
and I just share that image with you guys as just a word of encouragement

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:40.600
that despite what things may look like on the outside

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:45.600
we are still being held and there

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:50.600
can be this fear that somehow God has left the room

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:55.600
at times when it looks so bleak or so dark or so gray

00:07:55.600 --> 00:08:00.600
and I just want us to take this thought into the service

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:05.600
with us tonight that he is still here. He has not left

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:10.600
and he is still working just as much when it's obvious

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:15.600
and evident as he is when it's not so obvious and not so evident

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:20.600
and I just want us to cling to that together and really just

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:25.600
allow that to be a reminder to open our hearts and our posture

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:30.600
to what God is doing around us and to just ask that he would

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:35.599
awaken us and make us come alive to that reality.

00:08:35.599 --> 00:08:40.599
So for tonight I think I'm going to save our

00:08:40.599 --> 00:08:45.599
announcements and some of the details that are going on. We definitely want to give you details about the

00:08:45.599 --> 00:08:50.599
book club that's coming up this next month in February and all of that

00:08:50.599 --> 00:08:55.599
and I'll come back to that and we'll post links and all that but right now I just wanted to pray

00:08:55.599 --> 00:09:00.599
and for us to be able to transition into a time of worship together and

00:09:00.599 --> 00:09:05.599
we're going to let Mindy and Melody lead us in that but would you just open your heart with me

00:09:05.599 --> 00:09:10.599
and let's engage the work

00:09:10.599 --> 00:09:15.599
that God has for us tonight. God I just

00:09:15.599 --> 00:09:20.599
thank you. I just thank you for the reminder that

00:09:20.599 --> 00:09:25.599
you do not leave us. You do not forsake us

00:09:25.599 --> 00:09:30.599
and that you're doing things even when we cannot see that you are always

00:09:30.599 --> 00:09:35.599
actually doing things that we have no idea of that we are

00:09:35.599 --> 00:09:40.599
completely unaware of. So God I just

00:09:40.599 --> 00:09:45.599
cling to that truth right now and just

00:09:45.599 --> 00:09:50.599
invite you and give you full permission

00:09:50.599 --> 00:09:55.599
to continue working even now during this time together and

00:09:55.599 --> 00:10:00.599
would you make our heart sensitive to the work

00:10:00.599 --> 00:10:05.599
that you are doing and we thank you for the table.

00:10:05.599 --> 00:10:10.599
We thank you for the people gathered here each one wherever they may sit right now.

00:10:10.599 --> 00:10:15.599
God I ask that they would feel your nearness in your presence

00:10:15.599 --> 00:10:20.599
and the hope that you are still at work. It's in Jesus name I pray.

00:10:20.599 --> 00:10:25.599
Amen.

