but God

00:44:03.600 --> 00:44:05.600
sees

00:44:05.600 --> 00:44:07.600
God sees your spouse

00:44:07.600 --> 00:44:09.600
your friends, your co-workers

00:44:09.600 --> 00:44:11.600
your kids

00:44:11.600 --> 00:44:13.600
they see

00:44:13.600 --> 00:44:15.600
they know how you are doing

00:44:15.600 --> 00:44:17.600
on your internal scorecard

00:44:19.600 --> 00:44:21.600
and perhaps most importantly of all

00:44:21.600 --> 00:44:23.600
you see

00:44:23.600 --> 00:44:25.600
you know

00:44:25.600 --> 00:44:27.600
so I'll close with this

