00:44:51.600 --> 00:44:53.600
no one ever says

00:44:53.600 --> 00:44:55.600
okay five words

00:44:55.600 --> 00:44:57.600
CEO

00:44:57.600 --> 00:44:59.600
or

00:44:59.600 --> 00:45:01.600
world champion

00:45:01.600 --> 00:45:03.600
number one in sales

