what words do they

00:45:05.600 --> 00:45:07.600
choose

00:45:07.600 --> 00:45:09.600
it's always character words

00:45:09.600 --> 00:45:11.600
and relational words

00:45:11.600 --> 00:45:13.600
integrity

00:45:13.600 --> 00:45:15.600
faithful

00:45:15.600 --> 00:45:17.600
friend

00:45:17.600 --> 00:45:19.600
kind

00:45:19.600 --> 00:45:21.600
courageous

00:45:21.600 --> 00:45:23.600
so although the whole

00:45:23.600 --> 00:45:25.600
culture is just

00:45:25.600 --> 00:45:27.600
pushing you

00:45:27.600 --> 00:45:29.600
pushing I mean especially

00:45:29.600 --> 00:45:31.600
