00:45:39.600 --> 00:45:41.600
don't do it

00:45:41.600 --> 00:45:43.600
don't give in

00:45:43.600 --> 00:45:45.600
obey Christ

00:45:45.600 --> 00:45:47.600
keep your focus

00:45:47.600 --> 00:45:49.600
within

00:45:49.600 --> 00:45:51.600
because that's the scorecard

00:45:51.600 --> 00:45:53.600
that really matters

00:45:53.600 --> 00:45:55.600
let me pray for you

00:45:55.600 --> 00:45:57.600
Lord Jesus

00:45:59.600 --> 00:46:01.600
we want to

00:46:03.600 --> 00:46:05.600
we want to live focused

00:46:05.600 --> 00:46:07.600
intentional

00:46:07.600 --> 00:46:09.600
meaningful beautiful

00:46:09.600 --> 00:46:11.600
Christ like lives

00:46:11.600 --> 00:46:13.600
that's what we want to do

00:46:13.600 --> 00:46:15.600
we don't want a Christianity

00:46:15.600 --> 00:46:17.600
that's just a bunch of

00:46:17.600 --> 00:46:19.600
outward rituals

00:46:21.600 --> 00:46:23.600
that somehow don't

00:46:23.600 --> 00:46:25.600
