when people interact with us

00:46:37.600 --> 00:46:39.600
we want them

00:46:39.600 --> 00:46:41.600
to just get the sense

00:46:41.600 --> 00:46:43.600
that they've

00:46:43.600 --> 00:46:45.600
been with someone who loves

00:46:45.600 --> 00:46:47.600
them really well

00:46:47.600 --> 00:46:49.600
God we want to thrive

00:46:49.600 --> 00:46:51.600
in our second scorecard

00:46:53.600 --> 00:46:55.600
and so God right now in our

00:46:55.600 --> 00:46:57.600
divine moment

00:46:57.600 --> 00:46:59.600
God hear our prayer

00:46:59.600 --> 00:47:01.600
that we want to thrive on our second

00:47:01.600 --> 00:47:03.600
scorecard and when we

00:47:03.600 --> 00:47:05.600
become

00:47:05.600 --> 00:47:07.600
when we get pulled out of our

00:47:07.600 --> 00:47:09.600
minds when we get pulled

00:47:09.600 --> 00:47:11.600
into the ways of the world God and we start

00:47:11.600 --> 00:47:13.600
to obsess and worry about

00:47:13.600 --> 00:47:15.600
scorecard number one would you

00:47:15.600 --> 00:47:17.600
just bring us back to what matters

00:47:17.600 --> 00:47:19.600
God remind us

00:47:21.600 --> 00:47:23.600
by your spirit

